# Build output and crash/hang artifacts cargo-fuzz writes locally — never
# committed. `corpus/` IS committed (see CONTRIBUTING.md, "Fuzzing"): it starts
# as this crate's small curated seed corpus, but a local fuzzing run grows it
# with generated inputs in place, so keep new local growth out of `git status`
# noise by tracking only the seeds you explicitly `git add`.
/target
/artifacts
